; One variable: two CLIP_ONLY owners G1 and G2 follow a plain item A in the show_behind_parent span of an inert
; owner O. Godot draws A, then each group over the canvas drawn so far, then O's regular child R.
; No other scene holds two clip_children groups and a plain item in one behind span, so none shows what each group copies.

